1
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:28,426
♪Break the chain, erase the curl♪

2
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:30,866
♪I rise up with my inner pearl♪

3
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:33,940
♪Self-rescue fire burning full♪

4
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:37,586
♪I'm the master of my rule♪

5
00:00:38,020 --> 00:00:40,026
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

6
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:42,946
♪Calm but full of pearls♪

7
00:00:44,260 --> 00:00:45,920
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

8
00:00:46,440 --> 00:00:49,066
♪I rule my whole own whirl♪

9
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:53,506
=Quite The Girl=

10
00:00:53,520 --> 00:00:54,020
(Adapted from the Tomato novel
"Quite The Girl.")

11
00:00:54,080 --> 00:00:54,600
(Author: Wo Shafei Kuxin)

12
00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:55,840
=Episode 19=

13
00:00:57,159 --> 00:00:58,679
Now, please enjoy

14
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:00,520
a treasured heirloom of the Lu family.

15
00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:10,280
(The Lus are loaded!)

16
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:20,400
Mr. Lu, to secure a deal with Dongchen,

17
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:23,680
you'd even make an exception and show

18
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:25,079
your family's treasure.

19
00:01:25,439 --> 00:01:26,439
And now...

20
00:01:26,439 --> 00:01:27,200
Now,

21
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:30,000
I'll give you all

22
00:01:30,879 --> 00:01:32,120
a closer look.

23
00:01:33,020 --> 00:01:35,813
♪I keep my calm, hide all my soul♪

24
00:01:36,240 --> 00:01:38,880
♪Bite back tears, hold every pain♪

25
00:01:39,260 --> 00:01:42,013
♪Silently plan to break the chain♪

26
00:01:42,540 --> 00:01:44,373
♪No one's shelter, no one's reliance♪

27
00:01:46,159 --> 00:01:47,040
Lu Mingyu!

28
00:01:51,159 --> 00:01:53,079
Mr. Lu, should we do something?

29
00:01:53,480 --> 00:01:54,719
No! I'll handle it.

30
00:01:55,980 --> 00:01:58,480
♪Wisdom sharp like blade unseen♪

31
00:01:59,879 --> 00:02:00,959
That's odd, Mr. Lu.

32
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:04,239
Your family treasure
still looks too new,

33
00:02:04,799 --> 00:02:06,959
and its texture seems rather crude.

34
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:09,680
You're mistaken.

35
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:11,039
I need a restorer right away.

36
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:14,319
(This antique really is a fake.)

37
00:02:15,719 --> 00:02:17,719
(Lu Qiuliang.)

38
00:02:19,639 --> 00:02:21,800
How dare you switch it out

39
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:23,520
and display the real heirloom?

40
00:02:23,879 --> 00:02:24,879
Duan's always wanted

41
00:02:24,879 --> 00:02:26,439
to see us make fools of ourselves.

42
00:02:26,479 --> 00:02:26,960
And now,

43
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:28,759
you're helping them, you know?

44
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:30,759
Helping him?

45
00:02:31,319 --> 00:02:32,400
I'm helping our family!

46
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:33,479
I'm protecting its future!

47
00:02:33,479 --> 00:02:34,439
And how exactly?

48
00:02:34,439 --> 00:02:35,680
By swapping out the heirloom?

49
00:02:36,199 --> 00:02:37,039
That's your idea of helping?

50
00:02:37,319 --> 00:02:38,280
Everyone's watching.

51
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:39,159
Is this helping?

52
00:02:39,159 --> 00:02:39,840
Lu Mingyu!

53
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:42,080
If you hadn't smashed it in public,

54
00:02:42,080 --> 00:02:43,120
who would've known it was fake?

55
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:47,800
Whatever tricks you pull,

56
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:50,360
you're still a spineless coward.

57
00:02:50,639 --> 00:02:51,319
You...

58
00:02:51,680 --> 00:02:53,520
You deserve a beating.

59
00:03:06,039 --> 00:03:07,400
Looks like you don't want

60
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:08,800
to work with Dongchen.

61
00:03:10,380 --> 00:03:11,226
(Partnership Agreement)

62
00:03:22,039 --> 00:03:22,960
Thank you, Mr. Duan,

63
00:03:23,199 --> 00:03:24,560
for giving us another chance.

64
00:03:24,639 --> 00:03:25,520
I'll sign right away.

65
00:03:29,759 --> 00:03:30,680
We can work together,

66
00:03:31,719 --> 00:03:33,039
but I want to add a clause.

67
00:03:33,439 --> 00:03:34,719
What clause? Go ahead.

68
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:37,199
A special talent protection clause.

69
00:03:37,520 --> 00:03:39,319
If you harm Lu Mingyu in any way

70
00:03:39,319 --> 00:03:41,000
during our partnership,

71
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:42,560
that's a breach of contract.

72
00:03:54,599 --> 00:03:55,840
What does this clause have to do

73
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:56,680
with our partnership?

74
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:58,120
I don't want my assistant

75
00:03:58,120 --> 00:03:59,800
to get beaten up
while delivering documents.

76
00:04:00,599 --> 00:04:01,680
It disrupts work.

77
00:04:02,640 --> 00:04:06,893
♪One glance, and I fell♪

78
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:08,800
Sure, no problem.

79
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:09,599
I'll sign.

80
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:14,599
Revise the contract.

81
00:04:15,759 --> 00:04:16,680
Yes, sir.

82
00:04:16,940 --> 00:04:20,480
♪Your face froze before my eyes♪

83
00:04:21,740 --> 00:04:23,760
♪I'm always here♪

84
00:04:25,340 --> 00:04:29,013
♪Wherever you go♪

85
00:04:29,319 --> 00:04:31,279
You don't have to make
a special clause for me.

86
00:04:31,959 --> 00:04:33,560
All companies that work with Dongchen

87
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:34,879
will have it in their contracts.

88
00:04:35,519 --> 00:04:36,480
You're not that special.

89
00:04:44,399 --> 00:04:45,879
Qin Yuan came to see me today.

90
00:04:46,399 --> 00:04:47,560
She demanded

91
00:04:47,879 --> 00:04:49,959
that we honor your engagement
to Qin Lian soon.

92
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:57,120
You're the head of the Lus.

93
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:59,240
Why let Qin Yuan, a mere junior,

94
00:04:59,240 --> 00:05:00,439
push you around?

95
00:05:01,839 --> 00:05:03,199
I was making a name for myself here

96
00:05:03,199 --> 00:05:04,360
before she was even around!

97
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:06,079
Then tell her

98
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:07,600
to call it off.

99
00:05:09,279 --> 00:05:10,120
Mr. Qin,

100
00:05:10,639 --> 00:05:12,079
I think we should call off

101
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:13,639
their engagement.

102
00:05:13,839 --> 00:05:15,600
Our family sincerely wants

103
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:17,040
an alliance with you.

104
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:19,680
Funny how fate works, though.

105
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:21,720
The lawyer

106
00:05:21,720 --> 00:05:24,519
who once handled your father's will

107
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:27,120
is now our legal counsel.

108
00:05:27,439 --> 00:05:28,959
Mr. Chen's getting on in years,

109
00:05:28,959 --> 00:05:31,439
so he sometimes reminisces.

110
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:34,279
As it happens, I recorded

111
00:05:34,439 --> 00:05:35,920
him discussing some details

112
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:38,399
of how he handled the will.

113
00:05:43,319 --> 00:05:44,759
The Qins' engagement is right here.

114
00:05:44,959 --> 00:05:45,680
Go cancel it.

115
00:05:46,079 --> 00:05:46,920
I'll be waiting.

116
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:48,319
If you can't do it,

117
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:49,839
I'll handle it myself.

118
00:05:53,079 --> 00:05:54,639
You'll marry him no matter what!

119
00:05:58,160 --> 00:05:59,079
Good work on the proposal.

120
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:01,319
We'll reward you with a bonus.

121
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:02,680
The amount won't disappoint you.

122
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:03,759
Mr. Duan.

123
00:06:06,519 --> 00:06:07,800
Can I ask for a different reward?

124
00:06:12,639 --> 00:06:14,560
You've never asked me
for a reward before.

125
00:06:14,879 --> 00:06:16,000
I thought you'd come back

126
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:18,040
with no worldly desires.

127
00:06:18,399 --> 00:06:19,120
Let's hear it.

128
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:21,560
What could make our Ms. Lu

129
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:23,360
finally ask for a favor?

130
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:25,439
I'd like to see
some surveillance footage.

131
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:31,120
(The lawyer)

132
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:33,959
(who once handled your father's will)

133
00:06:34,399 --> 00:06:36,439
(is now our legal counsel.)

134
00:06:37,079 --> 00:06:38,560
(Mr. Chen's getting on in years,)

135
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:40,800
(so he sometimes reminisces.)

136
00:06:41,319 --> 00:06:43,199
(As it happens, I recorded...)

137
00:06:44,439 --> 00:06:46,560
(No wonder he suddenly agreed.)

138
00:06:47,759 --> 00:06:48,319
How is it?

139
00:06:49,319 --> 00:06:50,319
Happy with your reward?

140
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:51,639
You're as efficient

141
00:06:52,279 --> 00:06:53,240
as ever.

142
00:06:55,800 --> 00:06:56,680
I have a client meeting

143
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:58,000
in 15 minutes.

144
00:06:58,759 --> 00:06:59,360
Got it.

145
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:00,959
(Let's pick a lucky day)

146
00:07:01,199 --> 00:07:02,279
(and hold the wedding.)

147
00:07:14,800 --> 00:07:19,280
♪They all believe♪

148
00:07:20,220 --> 00:07:23,440
♪Love begins at first sight♪

149
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:25,279
So your wedding leave is coming up.

150
00:07:27,199 --> 00:07:27,920
Let's go.

151
00:07:29,040 --> 00:07:30,199
Don't keep the client waiting.

152
00:07:30,340 --> 00:07:33,400
♪When Cupid's arrow flies♪

153
00:07:34,780 --> 00:07:39,000
♪Through two gazing eyes♪

154
00:07:41,160 --> 00:07:46,200
♪But they don't remember♪

155
00:07:47,740 --> 00:07:51,613
♪Passing by under green lights♪

156
00:07:54,140 --> 00:07:56,813
♪In the airport corner♪

157
00:07:57,580 --> 00:07:59,613
♪Bags between us♪

158
00:08:00,540 --> 00:08:05,586
♪Or someone dialed the wrong number♪

159
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:10,160
♪Fate's signal's always weak♪

160
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:11,360
Showing up at my place

161
00:08:11,879 --> 00:08:13,160
out of the blue at this hour...

162
00:08:14,959 --> 00:08:16,120
Isn't that against the rules?

163
00:08:17,279 --> 00:08:18,959
I'm not in the mood
to follow rules today.

164
00:08:20,580 --> 00:08:26,280
♪Cover both ears, hide all the clues♪

165
00:08:26,980 --> 00:08:32,746
♪One by one, they pass
before love is entrusted♪

166
00:08:32,879 --> 00:08:33,799
Don't tell me

167
00:08:35,039 --> 00:08:36,519
you can't control yourself

168
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:39,039
and want to rekindle our old flame.

169
00:08:42,639 --> 00:08:43,519
Had enough?

170
00:08:44,720 --> 00:08:45,480
Not yet.

171
00:08:49,080 --> 00:08:50,480
Greedy, aren't you?

172
00:08:50,679 --> 00:08:52,399
I meant today's reward wasn't enough.

173
00:08:53,399 --> 00:08:54,399
I want another one.

174
00:08:59,080 --> 00:09:00,039
What do you want this time?

175
00:09:01,039 --> 00:09:03,440
I want to end my engagement to the Qins.

176
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:10,879
Lu Mingye...

177
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:15,279
What makes you think

178
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:19,279
I'll steal you away a second time?

179
00:09:20,679 --> 00:09:21,840
I don't want to marry him.

180
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:26,679
And you don't want me to, either.

181
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:52,559
Thank you, Mr. Duan,

182
00:09:53,039 --> 00:09:54,480
for taking such good care of my fiancee.

183
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:56,399
When we get married,

184
00:09:56,799 --> 00:09:59,080
I hope you'll honor us
with your presence.

185
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:01,679
You are a match made in heaven.

186
00:10:02,279 --> 00:10:03,960
All I can do is wish you well.

187
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:11,279
Thank you all for coming tonight.

188
00:10:11,480 --> 00:10:13,039
I'm delighted to share with you

189
00:10:13,039 --> 00:10:14,039
some exciting news.

190
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:16,200
I, Qin Lian,

191
00:10:16,639 --> 00:10:18,159
am about to marry my fiancee...

192
00:10:18,159 --> 00:10:19,159
Qin Lian, you lying scumbag!

193
00:10:19,159 --> 00:10:20,679
Who's your real fiancee?

194
00:10:20,759 --> 00:10:21,799
Shall I show the video

195
00:10:21,799 --> 00:10:23,000
of you on one knee,

196
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:24,440
crying and begging me to marry you?

197
00:10:25,159 --> 00:10:26,600
How dare you announce your wedding here?

198
00:10:26,840 --> 00:10:28,720
You promised to marry me
at my grandpa's grave.

199
00:10:28,720 --> 00:10:29,919
Denying it now, huh?

200
00:10:30,279 --> 00:10:30,799
You...

201
00:10:31,600 --> 00:10:32,840
They meant nothing to me.

202
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:34,200
You're the one I truly love!

203
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:35,879
I'm officially informing you now:

204
00:10:35,879 --> 00:10:37,559
our engagement is over.

205
00:10:37,820 --> 00:10:40,280
♪They think I'm weak, easy to control♪

206
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:42,440
Mingyu!

207
00:10:43,519 --> 00:10:44,279
Don't run off!

208
00:10:44,399 --> 00:10:45,480
Was this your doing?

209
00:10:46,860 --> 00:10:49,573
♪Silently plan to break the chain♪

210
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:51,140
(Fire Extinguisher)

211
00:10:58,159 --> 00:11:00,200
Seems my sister gave you
quite a hard time.

212
00:11:00,679 --> 00:11:01,759
None of your business.

213
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:02,679
I've got plenty of ways

214
00:11:02,679 --> 00:11:03,879
to win her back.

215
00:11:04,320 --> 00:11:05,200
Give it a rest.

216
00:11:05,480 --> 00:11:07,240
Duan Xiuming never leaves her side.

217
00:11:07,559 --> 00:11:08,600
You want revenge?

218
00:11:08,840 --> 00:11:10,360
Threatening won't get you anywhere.

219
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:12,039
But if we team up,

220
00:11:12,039 --> 00:11:12,960
that's a different story.

221
00:11:13,200 --> 00:11:15,039
You work in the open,
and I work in the shadows.

222
00:11:15,559 --> 00:11:16,440
Whatever you can't do,

223
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:17,919
I can.

224
00:11:23,279 --> 00:11:25,840
How come I never noticed you're so fun?

225
00:11:28,360 --> 00:11:28,960
So, tell me.

226
00:11:29,799 --> 00:11:30,600
What's your plan?

227
00:11:39,320 --> 00:11:40,799
Mr. Duan,

228
00:11:40,799 --> 00:11:43,080
you've honored us with your visit.

229
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:44,720
If you give me the art development plot

230
00:11:44,720 --> 00:11:45,320
in the east of the city,

231
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:47,440
I'll make it worth your while.

232
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:48,799
What a vision.

233
00:11:48,799 --> 00:11:50,320
Win-win cooperation has always been

234
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:51,519
Dongchen's guiding principle.

235
00:11:51,919 --> 00:11:53,279
I look forward to our talks.

236
00:11:53,399 --> 00:11:54,639
That's wonderful.

237
00:12:00,039 --> 00:12:00,519
Hello?

238
00:12:00,960 --> 00:12:02,320
Okay, got it.

239
00:12:02,720 --> 00:12:03,480
I'm on my way.

240
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:07,000
I'm terribly sorry, Mr. Duan.

241
00:12:07,159 --> 00:12:08,279
Something urgent came up.

242
00:12:08,279 --> 00:12:09,279
I need to take care of it.

243
00:12:09,399 --> 00:12:10,879
My assistant will show you
the meeting room.

244
00:12:11,039 --> 00:12:11,879
As soon as I'm done,

245
00:12:12,080 --> 00:12:13,080
I'll come to join you.

246
00:12:14,080 --> 00:12:14,559
All right.

247
00:12:51,360 --> 00:12:52,360
Hello? Who is this?

248
00:12:52,360 --> 00:12:53,159
Lu Mingyu.

249
00:12:53,399 --> 00:12:54,759
I have Duan Xiuming.

250
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:56,440
If you want him alive,

251
00:12:56,799 --> 00:12:59,080
come to Room 809 at Wanlai Hotel

252
00:12:59,200 --> 00:13:00,559
alone.

253
00:13:00,600 --> 00:13:02,600
And don't try anything clever.

254
00:13:38,250 --> 00:13:42,780
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

255
00:13:45,370 --> 00:13:48,943
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

256
00:13:52,330 --> 00:13:56,850
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

257
00:13:58,110 --> 00:14:03,010
♪Chimes and cicadas have loved so long♪

258
00:14:05,650 --> 00:14:11,850
♪A love letter written in song♪

259
00:14:12,410 --> 00:14:17,103
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

260
00:14:19,730 --> 00:14:25,716
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

261
00:14:26,490 --> 00:14:32,063
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

262
00:14:32,950 --> 00:14:39,690
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

263
00:14:40,750 --> 00:14:42,770
♪Close your eyes and count♪

264
00:14:43,050 --> 00:14:47,470
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

265
00:14:47,470 --> 00:14:51,670
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪
